    "title": "Downey council advances ballot measure to provide $1,000 monthly compensation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eric Pierce ,\n15 hours ago DOWNEY — The Downey City Council voted 4-1 Tuesday night to place a standalone measure on the Nov. 3 ballot that would allow council members to receive $1,000 per month in compensation, while maintaining their existing reimbursement structure. Councilman Hector Sosa cast the lone dissenting vote. If approved by... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
